  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Set in a world of angels with various kinds of wings. Misora, a young girl who attends a preparatory school, tries to be a good girl every day in order to win the “Angel's Waddle,” a prize given to the best students. One day, she is appointed as an elected member of the student council. She is happy to hear that the student council is run by students who have problems with the “seven deadly sins.\" Misora is assigned to the duties of the student council together with the most beautiful boy in her class, Agoshi, who is also appointed as  member of the student council."
  },
